/**
 * Sidebar file/directory tree browser.
 *
 * OpenWork upstream has no file-explorer panel: the workspace catalog/file
 * session API already exists server-side (`/files/sessions/*`), but nothing
 * in the React shell renders it as a browsable tree. This adds a "文件"
 * section under each workspace in the left sidebar (reusing the workspace
 * file-session + artifact-resolve endpoints and the existing artifact panel
 * for previewing/editing a clicked file), so users can see and open
 * workspace files without leaving the app.
 */
